            <title>[IGNITE-3162] WebSession: NPE is possible in WebSessionV2 ctor.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3162</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Constructor of &lt;tt&gt;WebSessoinV2&lt;/tt&gt; accept both genuine session and &lt;tt&gt;WebSessionEntity&lt;/tt&gt;. Both of them are nullable. If real values are nulls, NPE will be thrown. We need to rework that.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
